`= title|plumb note and task playground
`= area|examples

This file provides records for document queries, reverse references, task and event
queries, nesting, dependencies, recurrence, and guarded actions.

`# Document queries

Run these commands from the repository root:

`sh

|"
  cargo run -q -p plumb -- note --root examples --query 'title.matches("playground")'
  cargo run -q -p plumb -- note --root examples --query 'path.endsWith("plumb-ls.plumb")'
  cargo run -q -p plumb -- note --root examples --query '"index.plumb" in directly_referenced_by'
  cargo run -q -p plumb -- note --root examples --query '"plumb-ls.plumb" in transitively_referenced_by'

`# Interactive mode

`sh

|"
  EDITOR=nvim cargo run -q -p plumb -- note --root examples --interactive

The picker supports fuzzy matching, source previews, multiple selections,
`"$EDITOR" opening, and Ctrl-N file creation.

`# Task queries

`sh

|"
  cargo run -q -p plumb -- task --root examples
  cargo run -q -p plumb -- task --root examples --flat
  cargo run -q -p plumb -- task --root examples --query 'created != null && done == null'
  cargo run -q -p plumb -- task --root examples --query 'actionable'
  cargo run -q -p plumb -- task --root examples --query 'blocked'
  cargo run -q -p plumb -- task --root examples --query 'done != null'
  cargo run -q -p plumb -- task --root examples --query 'canceled != null'
  cargo run -q -p plumb -- event --root examples --query 'start >= timestamp("2026-07-30T00:00:00Z")'
  cargo run -q -p plumb -- event --root examples export-vdir --output /tmp/plumb-calendar

`- Try a task query

 `+ task

 `@ try-task-query

 `== created 2026-07-20T09:00:00+08:00
 `== wait 2026-07-20T18:00:00+08:00

 `note This open task becomes actionable when `"wait <= now".

 `- Inspect nested task output

  `+ task

  `@ nested-task

`- Read completed results

 `+ task

 `@ finished-query

 `== created 2026-07-20T10:00:00+08:00
 `== done 2026-07-20T11:00:00+08:00

`- Inspect canceled results

 `+ task

 `@ canceled-query

 `== created 2026-07-20T12:00:00+08:00
 `== canceled 2026-07-20T13:00:00+08:00

`- Inspect a blocked task

 `+ task

 `@ blocked-query

 `== depends #try-task-query

`- Review recurring task advancement

 `+ task

 `@ weekly-review

 `== due 2026-07-27T17:00:00+08:00
 `== wait 2026-07-27T09:00:00+08:00
 `== recur P1W

`- 2026-07-30T14:00:00+08:00--15:00 Review task query behavior

 `+ event

 `@ query-review

 `== tasks #try-task-query

 `note This event appears in event CEL queries, Web Agenda, and the read-only vdir projection.

Complete or cancel copies of these tasks with an explicit target:

`sh

|"
  cargo run -q -p plumb -- task --root examples complete plumb-notes.plumb#try-task-query
  cargo run -q -p plumb -- task --root examples cancel plumb-notes.plumb#blocked-query

`# Cross references

This file links to the `->[index|index.plumb] and the
`->[language server playground|plumb-ls.plumb#navigation], giving the
reverse-reference graph multiple edges.
